<span class="font-label-sm text-label-sm text-heritage-crimson uppercase tracking-widest mb-4 block">Care Guide</span>
<h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg md:text-display-lg text-architectural-blue mb-6">Tile Care &amp; Maintenance FAQ</h1>
<p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Handcrafted Athangudi tiles are made to last generations. Maintain their vibrant patterns and smooth finish with our curated maintenance guide.
            </p>
</header>
<!-- FAQ Content Grid -->
<div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter">
