<div class="aspect-square bg-cover bg-center rounded-lg hidden md:block" data-alt="A minimalist architectural interior featuring a floor made of traditional Athangudi tiles. Large windows allow natural light to fill the room, showcasing the durability and timeless sophistication of the cement patterns. The atmosphere is serene, disciplined, and modern." style="background-image: url('https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida/AP1WRLsqN4uGKrwEDRmWrpkY79jpZSc1CLBLlZHClBm8B_dWFaoLH8ZW7W0poLioXR8ifKFeAEUB-4NvFo38mQlFXP0dXQVj-oOVCJ_MRdLXMRAjhuOu9RL8Xejucqpbm6C1JzmvQ5I6MGL3MZUVTCMBsDmvKV1xkqZW5Am2j0EUB6fp6hX9kOKJwGdrobSG-imQzh7LX0DnMU7pkIGk5DBDMrMGrE7iy_zYZrkADiAYi-vN5fgJfrCQw46XNw')"></div>
</div>
